{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fliping the coin, win big!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Shark</strong> is a coin flipping roguelike deck builder all about beating randomness and creating powerful synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/7f3ff9ee9e0eb7daae0bb97723f7caae.poster.avif?t=1760414151\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/7f3ff9ee9e0eb7daae0bb97723f7caae.webm?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/7f3ff9ee9e0eb7daae0bb97723f7caae.mp4?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Unique Stickers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each sticker has its own unique effect. The system randomly deals them out, and you can freely stick them onto the coin.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Synergy Strategies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each sticker has a different synergy type, offering fresh strategic choices in every run.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Game Modes</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Campaign Mode</strong> - a finite run of levels. Earn enough wealth to beat the evil debt lord.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Endless Mode</strong> - once you beat Campaign Mode, you can jump straight into Endless Mode to chase infinite high scores and grind for endless riches!</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Coin Flip Challenge</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Flips aren\u2019t just random\u2014it's based on physics simulation for consistent results. After flipping, the stickers facing up activate their unique effect. Keep practicing to master the coin flip flow, and you'll be able to land the side you want every time.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Cartoon Art Style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This playful, retro cartoon look pulls you into a coin-flipping playground.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/8914b1a2206b470f1b67aa7fb3b13837.poster.avif?t=1760414151\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/8914b1a2206b470f1b67aa7fb3b13837.webm?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/8914b1a2206b470f1b67aa7fb3b13837.mp4?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stick stickers on the coin. Define your build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a wild array of stickers and stick them onto your coin to define your own sticker decks. Create varied and powerful synergies and builds, racking up enough tokens to crush the ruthless debt owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/37791f098c2c31a11b6f49cc2bd8d981.poster.avif?t=1760414151\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/37791f098c2c31a11b6f49cc2bd8d981.webm?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/37791f098c2c31a11b6f49cc2bd8d981.mp4?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape your flipping skills, become a real coin shark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your flow as you master each flip, string together combo streaks for massive bonuses, and perfect your technique to boost your base multiplier \u2014 growing your fortune sky-high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/5ee57337fd22b857c1b5d3ee40f234e4.poster.avif?t=1760414151\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/5ee57337fd22b857c1b5d3ee40f234e4.webm?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/5ee57337fd22b857c1b5d3ee40f234e4.mp4?t=1760414151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flip again and again, get into your zone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep flipping the coin like a real coin shark to active your sticker decks, build relentless combo streaks, stack insane multipliers, and grow ever richer. Pay off every debt and flip it rich!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873020/extras/f2615efa924d0230a25d60e3346c74b3.avif?t=1760414151\" width=1280 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Newbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873020/17def7a7629598538bfc124ba2baf84910ef4907.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3873020/44bce3bede6bfa3a8537468b6fcfd43ef7ca4ffe.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Sha